1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,600
The greatest truth isn't found in people's words.

2
00:00:03,480 --> 00:00:04,720
It's found in their actions.

3
00:00:05,960 --> 00:00:08,180
Sometimes people don't tell you the truth.

4
00:00:08,820 --> 00:00:10,200
Maybe they're protecting you.

5
00:00:11,060 --> 00:00:12,620
Maybe they're protecting themselves.

6
00:00:13,720 --> 00:00:16,200
Maybe they're hiding something you'll never know.

7
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:19,560
But no matter how carefully the truth is hidden,

8
00:00:20,480 --> 00:00:23,460
their actions always reveal what their words conceal.
